ORGANIZATIONAL CONFIGURATION NOTICE

This repository contains configuration values specific to Karme Choling, including but not limited to:

  - A Google OAuth 2.0 client ID scoped to the karmecholing.org Google
    Workspace domain. This client ID authenticates only against Karme
    Choling's organizational accounts and must not be used in any
    derivative work or external deployment.
  - Financial classification logic (functional expense categories,
    revenue source categories, vendor hierarchies) designed for Karme
    Choling's specific organizational structure and chart of accounts.
  - An integration endpoint for Anthropic's Claude API. This integration
    is disabled. Enabling this integration in any derivative or forked
    version of this software does not constitute authorization by Karme
    Choling. to transmit data on its behalf, and any such use is at
    the sole risk and liability of the person enabling it.

Any use of the "Karme Choling" name, logo, or organizational identity in
